<title>USA: VideoServer says Q1 EPS in line with estimates.</title>
<headline>VideoServer says Q1 EPS in line with estimates.</headline>
<dateline>BURLINGTON, Mass. 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>VideoServer Inc said Thursday that it expects to report revenues and earnings in line with analysts expectations for the first quarter ended March 31.</p>
<p>The First Call earnings estimate for the quarter is $0.20 per share.</p>
<p>The company said actual results would be released April 9, following the close of the stock markets.</p>
<p>VideoServer Inc provides hardware and software networking solutions ofr multipoint and multimedia conferences.</p>
